      "id": 3,
      "text": "Development of Johnson City began in 1959, though early efforts to annex the area to Gladstone failed in 1968.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnson_City%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Proponents of Johnson City's incorporation filed for an election just before a 1969 law aimed at preventing small cities took effect.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
