        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnson_City%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Johnson City residents are not eligible to participate in the Clackamas County library system or its county partners.",
